{"seq":1,"slug":"digital-electronics","title":"数字电子学","stage":"DONE","category":"hardware-electronics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/hardware-electronics/digital-electronics","rating":{"composite":3.65,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.13,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":1.75}},"introMarkdown":"# 数字电子学\n\n数字电子学是研究数字信号处理与数字系统设计的核心学科，涵盖从基础数制编码到复杂数字系统架构的完整知识体系。现代计算机、通信设备、嵌入式系统和人工智能硬件加速器的底层逻辑均建立在数字电子学原理之上。\n\n本知识库从数制与编码出发，逐步深入组合逻辑电路、时序逻辑电路，最终到达数字系统级设计与验证。通过系统学习，可以建立从单个逻辑门到完整数字系统的设计能力，理解硬件描述语言、时序约束、总线协议等工程实践中的关键概念。\n\n数字电子学的学习路径具有明确的层次递进关系：数制编码提供数据表示基础，组合逻辑实现无记忆的功能运算，时序逻辑引入状态存储与时间维度，系统设计则将前三者整合为可工程化的完整方案。掌握这一学科对于理解现代数字硬件的工作原理至关重要。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"number-systems","title":"数制与编码","docCount":3,"url":"/h/hardware-electronics/digital-electronics/number-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"binary-hexadecimal","title":"二进制与十六进制表示","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/digital-electronics/number-systems/binary-hexadecimal"},{"seq":2,"slug":"twos-complement-floating-point","title":"补码与浮点数表示","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/digital-electronics/number-systems/twos-complement-floating-point"},{"seq":3,"slug":"bcd-gray-code","title":"BCD 码与格雷码","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/digital-electronics/number-systems/bcd-gray-code"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"combinational-logic","title":"组合逻辑电路","docCount":3,"url":"/h/hardware-electronics/digital-electronics/combinational-logic","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"boolean-algebra-simplification","title":"布尔代数与逻辑化简","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/digital-electronics/combinational-logic/boolean-algebra-simplification"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mux-encoder-decoder","title":"多路选择器与编解码器","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/digital-electronics/combinational-logic/mux-encoder-decoder"},{"seq":3,"slug":"adder-alu-design","title":"加法器与 ALU 设计","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/digital-electronics/combinational-logic/adder-alu-design"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"sequential-logic","title":"时序逻辑电路","docCount":3,"url":"/h/hardware-electronics/digital-electronics/sequential-logic","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"flip-flop-types","title":"触发器类型","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/digital-electronics/sequential-logic/flip-flop-types"},{"seq":2,"slug":"counters-shift-registers","title":"计数器与移位寄存器","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/digital-electronics/sequential-logic/counters-shift-registers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"finite-state-machines","title":"有限状态机设计","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/digital-electronics/sequential-logic/finite-state-machines"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"digital-system-design","title":"数字系统设计","docCount":3,"url":"/h/hardware-electronics/digital-electronics/digital-system-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"timing-analysis-constraints","title":"时序分析与约束","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/digital-electronics/digital-system-design/timing-analysis-constraints"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bus-protocols-spi-i2c-uart","title":"总线协议：SPI、I2C 与 UART","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/digital-electronics/digital-system-design/bus-protocols-spi-i2c-uart"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-system-verification","title":"数字系统验证","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/digital-electronics/digital-system-design/digital-system-verification"}]}]}